@startuml warehouse-transfer-state
title Warehouse Transfer — Canonical V1 Lifecycle
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> REQUESTED
REQUESTED --> IN_TRANSIT : dispatch source quantity
IN_TRANSIT --> RECEIVED : receive destination quantity
RECEIVED --> [*]

note right of IN_TRANSIT
In-transit stock is not sellable at either location.
end note
@enduml
